Schnitzel patch for CodeWeavers' Wine (CrossOver 26.3.0 source drop)

kernelbase: add per-program command line additions from the registry.

If HKCU\Software\Wine\AppDefaults\<program file name>\CommandLineAppend is a non-empty
string, CreateProcessInternalW appends it to the command line of new processes of that
program (unless the command line already contains it). Schnitzel writes these values per
Pfanne. Steam's steamwebhelper.exe, for example, needs
"--no-sandbox --in-process-gpu --disable-gpu" to show its window on Wine for macOS;
CrossOver adds the same options through its closed compatibility layer.

Written for Schnitzel from scratch; licensed like Wine (LGPL-2.1-or-later).

